{marker indicators}{...}
{p 40 20 2}(Go up to {it:{help wbopendata##sections:Sections Menu}}){p_end}
{title:Topics}

{pstd}
Use {cmd:wbopendata, alltopics} to list all topics with indicator counts.
Use {cmd:wbopendata, search({it:keyword}) searchtopic({it:#})} to browse indicators in a specific topic.
Use {cmd:wbopendata, info({it:indicator_code})} to get detailed metadata for any indicator.
{p_end}

{marker toc}
{p 40 20 2}(Go up to {it:{help wbopendata##topicid:Topics}}){p_end}
